    <briefdescription>
<para>RAII guard that invokes a callable destructor when it goes out of scope. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Non-copyable and non-movable. Typically used to restore transient graph state (e.g. stage number) set for the duration of a code region. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
